  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Which required items were missing from the x-ray room\nin your critical
    inspection?\na. Local Rules\nb. Controlled Area designation\nc. No visual indication
    of an exposure (trefoil sign)\nd. Nothing, all documentation and safety features
    are in place\n\n2. When you tested the x-ray tube why was the anode spinning?\na.
    To add angular momentum to direct the x-rays\nb. To dissipate heat deposited
    by the electrons\n over a larger area\nc. To add energy to the x-ray production
    \nd. To avoid interference"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
